            <div xml:id="d465">

                <pb facs="0507" n="473" xml:id="pg473"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Barrett.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1897-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February
                                17, 1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Will Cheek estate and Siam consent one arbitrator, say governor Straits
                    Settlements, or other suitable person near by.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
